@startuml state-listing
' Spec 004 — listing lifecycle, extended from spec 003's diagram of the same name.
' Must agree with REQ-004-5..8 here and with REQ-003-5..11 in spec 003.
' Solid arrows: Admin actions, specified in spec 004.
' Dashed arrows: Employer actions, specified in spec 003 (drawn here so the picture is whole).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #dcfce7
  BackgroundColor<<done>> #E8E8E8
  BackgroundColor<<unseen>> #f8fafc
  BorderColor #94a3b8
}

state "Draft" as Draft <<unseen>>
state "Pending approval" as Pending
state "Published" as Published <<public>>
state "Rejected" as Rejected
state "Closed" as Closed <<done>>
state "Taken down" as TakenDown <<done>>

[*] -[dashed]-> Draft : employer saves\na new listing (003)
Draft : only the employer sees it
Draft : Admins never see a Draft
Draft -[dashed]-> Draft : edit (003)
Draft -[dashed]-> Pending : submit (003)\n(complete, within the limit)\nAdmins are emailed
Draft -[dashed]-> [*] : delete (003)

Pending : in the approval queue, longest-waiting first
Pending : Admin can approve, reject or edit
Pending -[dashed]-> Draft : withdraw (003)\nleaves the queue
Pending --> Published : Admin approves\n(region must be active)\nemployer is emailed
Pending --> Rejected : Admin rejects with a reason\nemployer is emailed the reason
Pending --> Pending : Admin edits\nemployer is emailed

Rejected : back with the employer, who sees the reason
Rejected : Admin can read it, nothing else
Rejected -[dashed]-> Rejected : edit (003)
Rejected -[dashed]-> Pending : resubmit (003)\n(complete, within the limit)\nAdmins are emailed
Rejected -[dashed]-> [*] : delete (003)

Published : visible to everyone (005)
Published : gets its public address on approval (005)
Published : Admin can take down or edit
Published -[dashed]-> Closed : employer closes (003)
Published --> TakenDown : Admin takes down with a reason\nemployer is emailed the reason
Published --> Published : Admin edits\nemployer is emailed

Closed : final for everyone; kept in My listings
TakenDown : final for everyone — no restore
TakenDown : employer sees the reason; kept in My listings

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | solid arrow | Admin action (this spec) |
  | dashed arrow | Employer action (spec 003) |
  | green | publicly visible |
  | grey | final: no actions for anyone |
  | pale | not visible to Admins |
endlegend

note as N1
  Nobody is emailed about their own action:
  an Admin acting on their own listing sends no email,
  and an Admin who submits one is not emailed (REQ-004-9, -10).
end note
@enduml
